  "notes": [
    "**Tener** is completely irregular",
    "Present: stem change e→ie (except nosotros) plus irregular \"yo\" form (tengo)",
    "Preterite: completely irregular stem \"tuv-\"",
    "Imperfect: regular -ER pattern based on infinitive stem \"ten-\"",
    "Pretérito Perfecto: regular past participle **tenido**",
    "Future: irregular stem \"tendr-\" (not \"tener-\")",
    "Condicional: irregular stem \"tendr-\" + conditional endings",
    "Used in many idiomatic expressions: *tener hambre* (to be hungry), *tener que* (to have to)",
    "Don't confuse with **haber** (to have - auxiliary)"
  ],
